### Команда: APP ARCHIVE NOW

**Контекст:** @.cursor/rules/app_developer/mainrule-core.mdc  
**Gates:** @.cursor/rules/app_developer/isolation_rules/_lean/archive.mdc

## Hot path

1. Archive only an epic whose APP QA and context-sync are complete and whose cursor is DONE.
2. Move the full `memory-bank/app/{plan,implement,creative,qa,bugfix}/<epic_id>/` tree to the mirrored archive path.
3. Rewrite external references and preserve the single epic history; do not split it into BACK/FRONT/INTEG archives.
